Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Surprise-and-Shine-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17236,\"date\":\"2026-08-28T09:28:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-28T07:28:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"concept-video-iphone-ultra-pieghevole-presentazione\",\"title\":\"Concept video: così potrebbe presentarsi l’iPhone Ultra pieghevole\",\"excerpt\":\"Un concept video firmato da Gunhoo Lee prova a immaginare la presentazione dell’iPhone Ultra pieghevole: un’anteprima digitale curata e molto realistica.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/iphone-ultra-foldable-video-concept-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-ultra-foldable-video-concept\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17230,\"date\":\"2026-08-28T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-28T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-evento-9-settembre-2026-iphone-18-pro-iphone-pieghevole\",\"title\":\"Apple annuncia l’evento del 9 settembre 2026: iPhone 18 Pro e primo iPhone pieghevole\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha annunciato un evento per il 9 settembre 2026. In agenda iPhone 18 Pro, iPhone 18 Pro Max, il primo iPhone pieghevole e nuovi Apple Watch.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/evento-apple-2026-768x384.webp\",\"imageAlt\":\"evento-apple-2026\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17224,\"date\":\"2026-08-26T12:33:21+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-26T10:33:21+00:00\",\"slug\":\"chip-m6-svela-cosa-aspettarsi-dall-iphone-18-pro-a20-pro-prestazioni-efficienza\",\"title\":\"Il chip M6 svela cosa aspettarsi dall’iPhone 18 Pro: l’A20 Pro punta tutto su prestazioni ed efficienza\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha presentato l’M6, primo chip di una nuova generazione. Le sue specifiche indicano la direzione dell’A20 Pro per iPhone 18 Pro: più prestazioni ed efficienza.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/iphone-18-pro-chip-a20-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-18-pro-chip-a20\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":7,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17196,\"date\":\"2026-08-25T15:09:09+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-25T13:09:09+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuovo-mac-mini-arrivo-prima-evento-iphone-18-pro\",\"title\":\"Nuovo Mac mini in arrivo prima dell’evento iPhone 18 Pro\",\"excerpt\":\"Un nuovo Mac mini sarebbe pronto al lancio prima dell’evento dedicato a iPhone 18 Pro. Ecco cosa aspettarsi e perché la tempistica conta.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/mac-mini-blue-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"mac-mini-blue\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":6,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17189,\"date\":\"2026-08-25T12:17:31+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-25T10:17:31+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-5-due-modelli-9-settembre\",\"title\":\"AirPods 5 in arrivo: due modelli già dal 9 settembre\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple starebbe preparando l’annuncio di due nuovi modelli AirPods 5 già mercoledì 9 settembre. Come per AirPods 4, ci sarebbero versioni con e senza cancellazione attiva del rumore.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/airpods-4-new-new-orange-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-4-new-new-orange\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewC